{
  "name": "get_status_shape",
  "description": "GetStatus is an honest snapshot: version, schemaVersion, nowUnix, pending/leased counters, enabled schedules, running timers, consumers with alive, and the built-in home/tasks/scenario queues. scenarioExecutionSupported and other false/zero fields are omitted by protojson until they become true/non-zero; scenarioStoreSupported is true because v2 stores scenario definitions.",
